  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "fnbm-current-sweep-results",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tfnbm-current-sweep-results\n\t\n\nGrid-sweep trial results for fnbm-current.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Info\n\t\n\n\nRows: 730\nColumns: 29\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tColumns\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nColumn\nType\nDescription\n\n\n\t\t\ntrial_id\nValue('string')\nUnique id for this trial: {sweep_name}__{combo_name}\n\n\nexperiment_name\nValue('string')\nExperiment folder slug this trial belongs to, e.g. fnbm-current\n\n\nsweep_name\nValue('string')\nBase run name for the whole sweep (config['run']['name'] before per-combo suffixing)\n\n\ncombo_name\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/arushram/fnbm-current-sweep-results.",
  "alternateName": [
    "arushram/fnbm-current-sweep-results"
  ],
